            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.10.17+MAT.10.18+MAT.10.19+MAT.10.20"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mat. 10.17-20",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.12.11+LUK.12.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Lk. 12.11-12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " “Enywe mwabeene khukhwola mube barekeerefu. Bakhamutiile ne khumuyila mu koti, bakhamupile mu sinakooki, mukheme ebweeni we baruki ne babaami sikila ese, khubaboolela Elomo Endayi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne, sisiakamo ne sikhoola tawe Elomo Endayi khukhwola yilwachibwe khu baandu boosi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne bamutiila bamuyila mu koti, mukheendekhelela siise ne sikhoola khu niko kane mulome tawe. Siise ne siolile loma liosi liosi nilio muelesiibwe sikila kamakhuwa niko mucha khuloma se kali kakenywe tawe, kakhaame khu Roho Omutakatifu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Babaandu baliaana bawandaayabwe babene khukhwirwa, ne bapaapa boosi bakhakhole bario khu babaana babwe. Babaana balikaluukhana khu basaasi babwe mala babakhole berwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.10.22"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mat. 10.22",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Boosi balimubiila enywe sikila lisina liase. Ne kakhali oyo owikhaliilikha khukhwola khusiakamo niye olionisibwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
