            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DAN.9.27"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Dan. 9.27",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DAN.11.31"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "11.31",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DAN.12.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "12.11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " “Mukhabone ‘Sibiilisio sie Lilionaka’ siemile niio sikhenyibwa tawe. (Likhebusia khu baasoma: manyilisia niko siboola). Abwenao abo bali mu Buyuda khukhwola belukhe bache mu ngulu ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.17.31"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Lk. 17.31",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " omundu oli khunju yewe khukhwola alekhe khu mala siise bali ekhe engile munju khubukula sisiindu siosi siosi ache nasio tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omundu oli mu mukuunda akhacha munju khubukula engubo yewe tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kaliba kamabi lukali khu bakhasi bali ne bisoombo ne bamaayi bali ne babaana batoro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Saba khu Wele muli bibiindu bino bikhakholekhana mu munaane tawe! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DAN.12.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Dan. 12.1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.7.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Bikh. 7.14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Sikila siibi sie chindaalo ng'enecho sikhabe siboofu khukhila sisiindi siosi siosi khukhwama mu lirakikha nga Wele ne abaang'ana sibala khukhwola siise sino. Lundi se silibao siibi sisiindi sikali lukano luno tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne kakhali Omwami embiyisie chindaalo echo, abanga sakholile ario tawe, andi mbao oliona tawe. Khwako aboombisie chindaalo khulwe barobore bewe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
