        },
        {
          "text": "“Ne omundu yesi yesi nakhuboolela ali, ‘Lola Kristo oyu siina’ namwe ‘Lola niyo oyo’ okhamusuubila tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Babelaanga kristo ne bang'oosi be bubeeyi baleecha. Balakhola kamayia ne kamakhuwa ke khuukia khukhwenya khubea akhaba barobore ba Wele, ne kanyalikhana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ba meso, namubooleele buli siindu biise ne bikhoola tawe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Liliicha lio Mwana wo Mundu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
